  photophoretic force, He at rho_off(10 cm,36 TeV)=6.8e-01 kg/m3, dT=0.1 mK across the 3 cm sphere: ~1.4e-15 N
  photophoretic force, Xe at rho_off(10 cm,6 TeV)=1.9e-02 kg/m3, dT=1.0 mK across the 3 cm sphere: ~6.7e-13 N
  photophoretic force, Xe at rho_off(10 cm,6 TeV)=1.9e-02 kg/m3, dT=0.1 mK across the 3 cm sphere: ~6.7e-14 N
  photophoretic force, Xe at rho_off(10 cm,36 TeV)=6.8e-01 kg/m3, dT=1.0 mK across the 3 cm sphere: ~1.9e-14 N
  photophoretic force, Xe at rho_off(10 cm,36 TeV)=6.8e-01 kg/m3, dT=0.1 mK across the 3 cm sphere: ~1.9e-15 N
